00:32:22 Description terms
00:37:40 New definition of description terms
00:41:06 "Pegasize"
00:42:14 Suggested grammar for "pegasize"
00:43:43 Use and mention
00:45:12 Lojban and logic - second-order logic
00:47:15 Lojban and logic - third/higher-order logic
00:52:06 Lojban and logic - multi-valued logic
00:53:13 Lojban and logic - modal logic
00:54:20 Summary
00:55:28 Discussion - Russell's interpretation
00:58:16 Discussion - Expressive power of Lojban and Logic
01:01:04 Discussion - Strong/weak principle of linguistic relativity
01:02:04 Discussion - No language, no thought?
